          "number": 2,
          "createdAt": "2026-09-23T21:50:00+00:00",
          "contentType": "comment",
          "contentHtml": "<p>Sounds like interference: everyone in your building is home and on Wi-Fi at the same time. Try changing the channel in the router settings, or use 5 GHz if your devices support it.</p>",
